+                 solvent_name: Optional[str] = None):
         """
         Parent transition state class
 
         -----------------------------------------------------------------------
         Arguments:
-            atoms (list(autode.atoms.Atom)):
+            atoms: Atoms with positions and symbols
 
-        Keyword Arguments:
-            reactant (autode.species.Species): If None then mode checking will
